WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
This is Matt Gray. He gives high-fives.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.100
And this is a cardboard cut-out of Matt Gray,

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.060
assembled by a crack team of professionals.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:13.460
But which one can get more high-fives in ten minutes?

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.340
Tonight, on the mean streets of York, We find out.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:20.680
This is the Matt Gray High Five Face Off.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.780
Well you join us here on this cloudy December afternoon in York.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:29.140
Cut-out's in position, and Matt's ready, so lets start the clock.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.700
Both of them have ten minutes to get as many high fives as possible

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.060
Slow start for the cut-out there, but Matt is straight off with

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.740
a Left-Handed Double-Take Spin, an excellent opening gambit for 2 points.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.700
A bit of interest from some local kids there, but..

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.280
No, only one high five given there, that's just 1 point for the cut-out.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.900
Matt's going for the pensioners, she spurned him but...

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.160
Yes! That's good.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.540
The band have struck up by the cut-out and it looks quiet...

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.920
No, wait! Thank you, madam. Glad you enjoyed it.

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.420
Three minutes in, and it looks like Matt's having a bit of trouble.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.200
Following people doesn't help that much-

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.260
Oh and that's a Raised-Child Slow Slap; 1 point for the cut-out there.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:07.620
Matt: High-five?

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.180
Matt: High-five, sir?

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:12.680
He's asking the questions, but he's not getting the answer he wants.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.780
That's not a high-five, That's a punch in the hand!

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:20.260
Discussions of some kind-

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.500
Oh! That's a high-ten!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:26.060
That's the kind of professionalism we've come to expect from a contender of this caliber. Sheer class.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.820
The cut-out, left mostly ignored, with a low in the crowd,

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.820
I'm fairly certain Matt's pulling ahead.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.240
One from the child, and one from the mother!

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.240
Housewives favorite Matt Gray strikes again.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:38.860
Big, big crowds here today-

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:39.900
Oh, whats this?

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.900
Oh that's incredible! A Double-Granny Simultaneous Side Swipe!

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.960
I haven't seen one of those since Italy in the semi-finals in 1983-

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:48.560
And where did she come from? Out of nowhere, that's where!

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.440
Out of nowhere and back to the streets and-

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.500
He's got a second one! Unbelievable!

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.740
Even if the kids in hats go for the cut-out, surely it doesn't stand a chance now!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.260
Matt Gray in full on bounce mode now, surely nothing can stop this contender.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.220
He's absolutely in the zone and the cut-out is just left standing still

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.260
One!

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:04.900
Two!

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.140
Three!

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.920
Four in a row! This is incredible!

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:11.920
She's not gonna be enough to save the cut-out's chances and with

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.180
the clock starting to run short-

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:16.060
Oh! That's a full on Power-Blast! That's got to hurt!

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.440
But it just doesn't show!

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:21.040
And even the crowds at the cut-out seem to sense the impending crushing defeat! And-

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.340
OH MY WORD! It seems you CAN get the staff these days!

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:28.240
No contest here; Matt Gray is dozens of high-fives ahead of his competitor.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.600
The cut-out just getting scorned looks from teenage girls-

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.260
Oh but Matt Gray is ahead with the under-18 crowd and the over-30s. As I said before,

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:36.980
Housewives favourite, Ink and card can't compete there!

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:38.240
One! Two! Three!

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:41.300
Even the police, it seems, have no interest in a free high-five from the cut-out-

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.480
Oh but what's this!? It's a traffic warden!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.760
Can he get the traffic warden to...?-

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.180
YES! YES! UNBELIEVABLE!

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:51.240
The first authority figure of the night, the points go to Matt Gray in the final ten seconds!

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:54.960
The cut-out, I'm sure, thinks it's all over.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:58.980
OH IT IS NOW! A Flying Two-Handed Busted Jump with Follow-through!

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.960
[BUZZER] Never attempted in professional competition before, but it worked!

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.360
The final scores, ladies and gentlemen! The end of the round, the end of the contest

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:08.540
It's a staggering 112 to Matt Gray

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.680
And only 23 to his cardboard replica.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:15.080
That has been the Matt Gray High Five Face Off.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.080
The victor, Matt Gray!

